                <p style={{fontSize:"15px",color:"var(--muted)",lineHeight:"1.8",marginBottom:"44px"}}>The product shipped and went live in hospital workflows. Staff described the experience as more comfortable than complex systems used in parallel during emergencies. The impact was behavioural — the system became clearer, calmer, and more dependable under pressure.</p>
